    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "3. As per the prosecution case, the petitioner is said to have committed rape upon the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1012,
      "end": 1106,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "4. The petitioner is in custody since 11.02.2025.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1107,
      "end": 1157,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "11.02.2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1146,
          "end": 1156
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "5. From the FIR, it appears to be a case of consensual sex as the informant is a major and she is a married lady having a child also.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1159,
      "end": 1292,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "6. Considering the fact that this is case of consensual sex, this application is allowed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1294,
      "end": 1383,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
